{"asset_key":"mn2/env_story_10370060","episode":"mn2","category":"env_story","story_id":"10370060","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1037006001:1":{"text":"今のところはな。","source_cn":"目前一切尚好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDCB7D58224BC3535","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1037006002:1":{"text":"狂ったモンスターたちは、まだ村の近くまで来てはいない。","source_cn":"那些发狂怪物目前距离村子还有一定距离。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF4A204BF9B8FAD0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1037006003:1":{"text":"だがメッツァーと私は安心できなくてな、二人でここの見張りを買って出たんだ。","source_cn":"美特苏尔和我有些担心，所以主动提出来守卫这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F17995F58BD0D32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1037006004:1":{"text":"この道さえ突破されなければ、村がモンスターに襲われる心配はない。","source_cn":"只要我们守住这条路，怪物就不能袭击我们的村子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A459A9153CAFD83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:守卫契尔忒":{"text":"守衛チェルット","source":"守卫契尔忒","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}